{"4545480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SYNDYX", "steam_appid": 4545480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You woke up underground.</i><br><i>There are monsters.</i><br><i>Everything is broken.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good news:<br><strong>You have a train.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bad news:<br><strong>It’s your only chance to survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab up to 3 friends (or go alone if you don't like yourself) and dive into a collapsing underground complex filled with things that definitely want you dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your weaponized train from station to station, jump out, loot whatever you can get, and get back before something finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because something always finds you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features (or problems, depending on how you play)</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > A Train With Guns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, really.<br>Load your weapons. Shoot things. Miss horribly. Panic. Repeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op (Highly Unprofessional)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players working together*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*“working together” not guaranteed</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Loot Fast or Die Trying</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stations open for a limited time.<br>Go in, grab stuff, get out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or stay longer.<br>We dare you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Creatures That Hate You Personally</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They don’t follow rules.<br>They don’t care about your plans.<br>And they definitely heard you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fix Your Trash Train</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything breaks.<br>All the time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good luck.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You woke up underground.</i><br><i>There are monsters.</i><br><i>Everything is broken.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good news:<br><strong>You have a train.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bad news:<br><strong>It’s your only chance to survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab up to 3 friends (or go alone if you don't like yourself) and dive into a collapsing underground complex filled with things that definitely want you dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your weaponized train from station to station, jump out, loot whatever you can get, and get back before something finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because something always finds you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features (or problems, depending on how you play)</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > A Train With Guns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, really.<br>Load your weapons. Shoot things. Miss horribly. Panic. Repeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op (Highly Unprofessional)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players working together*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*“working together” not guaranteed</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Loot Fast or Die Trying</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stations open for a limited time.<br>Go in, grab stuff, get out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or stay longer.<br>We dare you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Creatures That Hate You Personally</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They don’t follow rules.<br>They don’t care about your plans.<br>And they definitely heard you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fix Your Trash Train</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything breaks.<br>All the time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good luck.</strong></p>", "short_description": "SYNDYX is a co-op horror for 1-4 players. Ride an armed train together, maintain its systems, and gather resources. Loot stations, avoid the monsters, and reach the surface!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Sp